        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanardsville%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Greene County Historical Society and Museum, located in Stanardsville, showcases artifacts that trace the town’s 19th‑century growth.",
